      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.5327407121658325
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "He now prays for suspension of sentence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 608,
      "end": 648,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "2. The petitioner says that he is already in custody for about three years two months.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 649,
      "end": 736,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1778109073638916
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "This is supported by the custody report filed by the State today.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 737,
      "end": 802,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14613784849643707
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "3. Let the report be kept with the records.\n4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 804,
      "end": 850,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "The petitioner says that the medical evidence does not support the prosecution case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 851,
      "end": 935,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14050868153572083
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "He has been falsely implicated.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 936,
      "end": 967,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.25328290462493896
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "There are several loopholes in the judgment under appeal.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 968,
      "end": 1025,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.14857077598571777
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "The first information report was lodged belatedly.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1026,
      "end": 1076,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3207172155380249
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "The signature of the defacto complainant is not there on the first information report.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1077,
      "end": 1163,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3022282123565674
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "5. Opposing the prayer, learned State Counsel and learned Counsel for the defacto complainant say that the medical evidence on record fully supports the prosecution case of rape.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1164,
      "end": 1343,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21701106429100037
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "Further, the version of the victim girl is wholly in consonance with her statement recorded under Section 164 Cr.P.C.\nThere is an eyewitness to the incident being the cousin of the victim girl who was present at the place of occurrence.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1344,
      "end": 1580,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 164",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 1442,
          "end": 1453
        },
        {
          "text": "Cr.P.C.",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1454,
          "end": 1461
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.37608447670936584
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "No leniency should be shown to the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 1581,
      "end": 1627,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.43184489011764526
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "Saifuddin Molla vs Unknown on 25 February, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/106978478/\n1 6.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1628,
      "end": 1736,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Saifuddin Molla vs Unknown on 25 February, 2026 Indian Kanoon",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1629,
          "end": 1690
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "We have considered the facts and circumstances of the case and the evidence on record.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1737,
      "end": 1823,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "The victim girl in her deposition vividly narrated the alleged incident.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1824,
      "end": 1896,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3114631474018097
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "Her deposition stood the test of cross examination.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1897,
      "end": 1948,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2941403090953827
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "Her cousin being P.W.7 has also deposed in aid of the prosecution case.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ANALYSIS",
      "start": 1949,
      "end": 2020,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20806661248207092
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "His evidence corroborates that of the victim girl.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2021,
      "end": 2071,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2709885239601135
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "7. Prima facie therefore, we find sufficient incriminating evidence against the petitioner.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2072,
      "end": 2164,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.15203242003917694
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "The medical evidence is also to the effect that there was injury in the external gentalia of the victim girl.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RATIO",
      "start": 2165,
      "end": 2274,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27841922640800476
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "8. On an overall prima facie assimilation of the evidence on record, we are not inclined to allow the petitioner's prayer for bail, at this stage.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 2276,
      "end": 2422,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "9. CRAN 1 of 2025 is dismissed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "RPC",
      "start": 2423,
      "end": 2455,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "CRAN 1 of 2025",
